Conditional Rendering Example in Page Composer

In Page Composer, these Groovy expressions are typically placed in the "Rendered" or "Read-only" property of a component to control visibility/editability:

Example: Make a DFF field visible only for HR Specialist:

SecurityContext.roles.contains('ORA_HR_SPECIALIST_JOB')


Example: Hide a button from employees:

!SecurityContext.roles.contains('ORA_PER_EMPLOYEE_ABSTRACT')
